## 变更 3 (P3-B)：operator[] const 去重

### 文件：runtime/builtin/array.h

**修改 3a：Array 类新增私有 locateLinear 方法（L139 附近，private 区）**

```cpp
// 在 private 区的 locateChunk 声明后新增：
ChunkLocation<T> locateLinear(int32_t idx) const;
```

**修改 3b：新增 locateLinear 实现（在 locateChunk 实现之前，L736 附近）**

```cpp
// P3-B: 提取 const 线性遍历逻辑，供 const operator[] 和 locateChunk 共用
template <typename T>
ChunkLocation<T> Array<T>::locateLinear(int32_t idx) const {
    if (idx <= length / 2) {
        // 从 head 往后
        ArrayChunk<T>* c = head;
        int32_t ci = 0;
        while (c && idx >= c->used) {
            idx -= c->used;
            c = c->next;
            ++ci;
        }
        return {c, idx, ci};
    } else {
        // 从 tail 往前
        int32_t back = length - idx - 1;
        ArrayChunk<T>* c = tail;
        int32_t ci = chunk_count - 1;
        while (c && back >= c->used) {
            back -= c->used;
            c = c->prev;
            --ci;
        }
        return {c, c->used - 1 - back, ci};
    }
}
```

**修改 3c：locateChunk 内部线性遍历改用 locateLinear（L742-765）**

```cpp
// 原（L742-765 的线性遍历分支）：
if (chunk_count <= 1 || !chunk_index || !chunk_index_valid) {
    if (idx <= length / 2) { ... }
    else { ... }
}

// 改为：
if (chunk_count <= 1 || !chunk_index || !chunk_index_valid) {
    return locateLinear(idx);
}
```

**修改 3d：const operator[] 改用 locateLinear（L877-889）**

```cpp
// 原：
template<typename T>
const T& Array<T>::operator[](int32_t index) const {
    if (index < 0 || index >= length) {
        throw Error{make_string("IndexError"), make_string("index out of range")};
    }
    // const 版本：不构建索引表，直接线性遍历
    ArrayChunk<T>* current_chunk = head;
    while (current_chunk != nullptr && index >= current_chunk->used) {
        index -= current_chunk->used;
        current_chunk = current_chunk->next;
    }
    return current_chunk->data()[index];
}

// 改为：
template<typename T>
const T& Array<T>::operator[](int32_t index) const {
    if (index < 0 || index >= length) {
        throw Error{make_string("IndexError"), make_string("index out of range")};
    }
    auto loc = locateLinear(index);
    return loc.chunk->data()[loc.local_idx];
}
```

